BuildRequires:  rust-rand
%endif


%description
More compact and efficient implementations of the standard synchronization
primitives.

%prep
%setup -q
cp %{SOURCE1} .
%{__patch} -p1 < %{SOURCE2}

# ==========================================================
# build section
# crate-type : dylib, proc-macro, cdylib, bin, etc.
